[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0010","text":"……心情不错嘛，雏菜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0020","text":"嗯～，今天的采访，超级开心的～！\n制作人也是吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0030","text":"是啊\n我也听得很入神"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0010","text":"……心情不错嘛，雏菜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0040","text":"呐，制作人！\n我们换条路回去吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0050","text":"从那边走感觉更有意思！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0060","text":"……嗯，好吧\n好，只要不太晚就没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0070","text":"呀哈～～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0080","text":"……感觉好新鲜啊\n看到的景色跟平时完全不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0090","text":"换换口味嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_02_0100","text":"哈哈\n是啊……！"}]
